<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy – Gamepad Tester" description="Privacy information for Gamepad Tester, a local browser-based controller diagnostic tool."><section class="article-hero"><div class="shell article-hero-inner"><span class="subpage-kicker">PRIVACY</span><h1>Input stays<br /><span>on your device.</span></h1><p class="lede">The MVP processes controller input locally in the browser and does not require an account.</p></div></section><section class="subpage-content shell"><article class="info-card"><h2>Controller input</h2><p>Gamepad buttons, axes and trigger values are read by the browser to update the visible tester. This site does not upload or store those values on a server.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h2>Future analytics</h2><p>If analytics or advertising is added in a production deployment, this policy should be updated to name the providers, cookies and user choices before launch.</p></article></section></BaseLayout>
